### Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "UnderrideRiskInParkingStructure" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :StateAnomaly ;
    :description "Vehicle following too closely in a low-visibility parking structure" ;
    :hasActor :vehicle1, :vehicle2 ;
    :hasObstacle :structureObstacle ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :nightCondition ;
    :hasRisk :rearEndCollisionRisk, :occlusionRisk .

:vehicle1 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Front vehicle (black SUV) in parking structure" .

:vehicle2 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Following vehicle (white SUV) in parking structure" .

:structureObstacle a :Obstacle ;
    :description "Low ceiling/structural beams in parking garage" .

:nightCondition a :NightCondition .

:rearEndCollisionRisk a :RearEndCollisionRisk ;
    :description "High risk of rear-end collision due to close following in low visibility" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 ;
    :confidenceScore "0.92"^^xsd:float .

:occlusionRisk a :OcclusionRisk ;
    :description "Risk of occlusion due to structural beams obstructing view" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 ;
    :confidenceScore "0.88"^^xsd:float .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.95"^^xsd:float .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.80"^^xsd:float .
```

